    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE DOWNLOAD LINK FOR THE DEMO IS ABOVE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Michael, a logical programmer, and his son Thomas, a rebellious graffiti artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both are unexpectedly digitized into a simulation alongside their quirky AI companion, KIKI, and bound by the mysterious Sixth Force. Together, you\u2019ll navigate their evolving relationship and tackle the puzzles of a surreal digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Swing and slide along rails, move platforms, and grow or shrink objects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Phase through walls and summon bridges across chasms \u2014 or between people.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sixth Force</i> is built around cooperation \u2014 play together in local co-op or online via Steam Remote Play. Either way, this journey is meant to be shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea2\u00a0<strong>The Bond Core Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glowing link between characters starts short and a bit frustrating \u2014 just like real-life tension. But as their bond deepens, it grows stronger and unlocks unique co-op super-powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.poster.avif?t=1749238539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.webm?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.mp4?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Telekinesis &amp; World Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects, solve puzzles, and reshape the world. As trust builds, you\u2019ll unlock the power to create, destroy, and transform your surroundings together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.poster.avif?t=1749238539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.webm?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.mp4?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f The Sixth Force in Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At full strength, the bond lets you make the intangible real \u2014 light becomes platforms,  and yes\u2026 you can fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.poster.avif?t=1749238539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.webm?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.mp4?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Dreamlike Simulations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal digital worlds built from the characters\u2019 talents, dreams, and memories \u2014 a journey through their inner lives, one level at a time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.poster.avif?t=1749238539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.webm?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.mp4?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Fun for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a seasoned gamer or new to co-op games, Sixth Force offers challenges and playful problem-solving for all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.poster.avif?t=1749238539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.webm?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.mp4?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef7\u00a0<strong>Fooling Around</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there\u2019s always time for fun, trolling, and messing with each other! Who found the combo?  Who\u2019ll win the tug-of-war with the bond?\u00a0Who\u2019ll slide down the plastic slide first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/080d6b07d1dae787d7310ba8e75e987c.poster.avif?t=1749238539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/080d6b07d1dae787d7310ba8e75e987c.webm?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/080d6b07d1dae787d7310ba8e75e987c.mp4?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Two controllers required\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <i>Sixth Force</i> is designed as a co-op-only experience. No single-player mode available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Shared-screen local &amp; online co-op</strong> \u2013 Whether you\u2019re playing side by side or via Steam Remote Play, the shared-screen setup keeps both players fully in sync and in the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Demo-preview of the full game\u00a0</strong>\u00a0- Play through the <strong>first two levels</strong> and get a taste of the story, mechanics, and atmosphere of <i>Sixth Force</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and follow Sixth Force and be the first to try the full adventure upon release!</strong><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1749238539\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1749238539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
